{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01246-s03","batch":1246,"shard":3,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":60,"shard_end_exclusive":80,"translated_count":5,"worker_id":"gpt56sol-auto11-20260906T011300Z-translation","updated_at":"2026-09-06T01:16:00Z","entries":[{"entry_index":60,"uid":"zhcn:9ef0e14117920fcf4945d7e8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔哇——比赛就快开始啦……\r\n但既然都来到这里了，\r\n就也只能好好面对咯——","source_fingerprint":"2e5be41516ff739ad6e2786b0b5a03262200a7bc1e8cc0b27b56462da2b50be8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20034"],"target_text":"U oa—— Race sắp bắt đầu rồi……\r\nNhưng đã đến tận đây,\r\nthì cũng chỉ còn cách nghiêm túc đối mặt thôi——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":61,"uid":"zhcn:25e4f0b36251ea09bbb90fc8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"反正也不是现在做点什么，\r\n就会有什么改变的嘛。\r\n我就照自己的步调去跑咯。","source_fingerprint":"cbbd4d90cffc40f3f433c90d43e5d54241aa9e65a2b63d4aa0cbcc6e65db822f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20035"],"target_text":"Đằng nào giờ có làm thêm gì\r\ncũng chẳng thay đổi được bao nhiêu.\r\nMình cứ chạy theo nhịp của mình thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":62,"uid":"zhcn:9ded3d1b56f4e25c26a40546","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呀～全都是看起来很强的对手啊——\r\n……但这时候要是我拿第一名，\r\n应该会非常有趣吧？","source_fingerprint":"c80b6bfdd5e794c9923f9182a96058d9f518540e46aaa6318b0e346a7fb12765","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20036"],"target_text":"Chà～ toàn đối thủ trông mạnh cả——\r\n…… Nhưng nếu lúc này mình về nhất,\r\nchẳng phải sẽ thú vị lắm sao?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":63,"uid":"zhcn:7c6c35a4f88c3f04f4779bf1","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"赢了是侥幸，\r\n输了也不意外——\r\n反正就是这种感觉啦——","source_fingerprint":"c94f989dce63673480b3e7ce65cd2269e438fe05763681b35d3ac6098123ee85","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20037"],"target_text":"Thắng thì là may mắn,\r\nthua cũng chẳng có gì lạ——\r\nđại khái là vậy đó——","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":64,"uid":"zhcn:700e77503b4025547dffb2ee","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好啦好啦——","source_fingerprint":"87331471ea174ed609328d3734d09672ad5f6cbbfe121e90863d9be860efd79a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1020","20038"],"target_text":"Rồi rồi——","reviewed":true}]}